**$50,000/year**.\n\nSo, the **pension rate per year of service** is:\n\n$$\n\\frac{50,000}{40} = 1,250 \\text{ dollars per year of service}\n$$\n\nSo, for each year of service, she gets **$1,250** per year of pension.\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Determine her pension after 30 years\n\nShe works for **30 years**, so her **annual pension** is:\n\n$$\n30 \\times 1,250 = 37,500\n$$\n\nSo, if she quits after 30 years, her **annual pension** will be:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{37,500}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{37,500}\n$$\n\nThis is her **annual pension** if she quits after 30 years.", "decode_seconds": 4.345639199949801, "draft_calls": 116, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 95, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "0a4f3a2a3c16c7a936e9bb48040a8a34a5ebd624b90afc44855d7cc390241de1", "method": "relay_cropped", "output_hash": "319aaa7af3be26670226c78b7ce250878d6f573a3cc6ab68c26ab611f5ed7a8f", "output_tokens": 492, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 23621360128, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 23886561280, "problem_id": "gsm8k/b8ef5dec533b9ddb", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 751.5143685340881, "prefill_full_target": 33.126625061035156, "prefill_relay": 0.14361600577831268, "relay": 22.636768013238907, "unattributed_runtime": 49.27277112752199, "verification_full_target": 3524.071578979492}, "proposal_lengths": [15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15], "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "25000", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 4.380765727721155, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 23886561280, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 23836229632, "target_calls": 116, "time_to